  "blocks": {
    "it-reached-the-cause-then-left--text-4": {
      "id": "it-reached-the-cause-then-left--text-4",
      "type": "text",
      "only": [
        "web"
      ],
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "p-1",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Qisheng Lu, "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Aoyang Fang",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "bold"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": ", Junjielong Xu, Jin'ao Shang, Songhan Zhang, Yifan Yang, Xiaochuan Yan, Pinjia He. "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "arXiv preprint",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "italic"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": ", 2026. Aoyang Fang and Pinjia He are co-corresponding authors."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "p-2",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "link",
              "href": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.21310",
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "arXiv"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " · "
            },
            {
              "type": "link",
              "href": "https://arxiv.org/pdf/2608.21310",
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "PDF"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " · "
            },
            {
              "type": "link",
              "href": "https://doi.org/10.48550/arXiv.2608.21310",
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "DOI"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "p-3",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "An RCA agent's final answer hides how the diagnosis was reached. Graded against each incident's fault propagation path, "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "5,000 trajectories",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "bold"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " of LLM agents show that correct runs stay on that path and act on what their queries return, while failed runs wander off it; wrong diagnoses trace to evidence never gathered, evidence misread, or reasoning detached from the evidence. DiagGuard, a guard built from these failures, raises Acc@1 in "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "all 14",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "bold"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " tested configurations, by 3.5 to 35.1 points."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "it-reached-the-cause-then-left--image-5": {
      "id": "it-reached-the-cause-then-left--image-5",
      "type": "image",
      "only": [
        "web"
      ],
      "assetId": "it-reached-the-cause-then-left--asset",
      "alt": "Figure 1: an annotated fault path, an agent trajectory by step range, and outcome metrics that see only the final answer",
      "caption": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Figure 1: the agent reaches the root-cause service at steps 37–40, leaves its metrics uninspected, rechecks the symptom and reports the affected service; Acc@k, MRR and MAP record only that final answer."
        }
      ],
      "width": 100,
      "alignment": "center"
    },
    "it-reached-the-cause-then-left--scene": {
      "id": "it-reached-the-cause-then-left--scene",
