        },
        {
          "id": "gains"
        }
      ],
      "data": {
        "plugin": "presmium.motion",
        "name": "PmScene",
        "durations": [
          6687,
          8916
        ],
        "fallback": {
          "type": "root",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "value": "DiagGuard adds a Verifier self-audit before the investigation, a Grounder's search-space profile before the first query and a Verifier soundness check before the answer. On the incident of Figure 6b the agent now reaches the storage tier (disk writes 15 → 105 Mbps) and answers tidb-tikv-0. Acc@1 gains (Figure 7a): ThinkDepth.ai on AIOps 2025 +6.5 / +9.0; on RCA100 GoS +10.5 / +15.8, OpsAgent +10.5 / +5.3, RCLAgent V2 +5.3 / +7.0, mABC +21.1 / +35.1, OpenRCA +19.3 / +14.0, ThinkDepth.ai +3.5 / +7.0 (Qwen / Doubao)."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        "language": "typescript"
      }
    }
  },
